{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a premium, editorial-style Shopify section for the babywear brand KISS & KRY, replicating the supplied reference image as closely as possible.
    
    STRICT INSTRUCTION: Do not redesign, reinterpret, or change the layout. Reproduce the same two-column composition, image arrangement, typography, colours, spacing, proportions, and visual hierarchy.
    
    1. OVERALL SECTION DESIGN
    
    Full-width section.
    
    Background colour: warm ivory / pale cream (#F5F3E7).
    
    Premium, minimal, Scandinavian-inspired babywear aesthetic.
    
    Content maximum width: 1200px.
    
    Desktop section padding: 65px 55px.
    
    Two-column layout:
    
    Left content column: 46%.
    
    Right visual column: 54%.
    
    Vertically centre both columns.
    
    Use generous whitespace.
    
    Avoid unnecessary decorative elements.
    
    2. LEFT COLUMN – BRAND STORY
    
    Create a vertically aligned content block.
    
    Eyebrow text:
    "— OUR STORY"
    
    Font: Montserrat Medium.
    
    Size: 10px.
    
    Uppercase.
    
    Letter spacing: 2px.
    
    Colour: muted olive green (#777D5D).
    
    Main heading:
    "For Every Kiss.
    For Every Cry."
    
    Font: Montserrat ExtraBold.
    
    Desktop font size: 40px.
    
    Line height: 1.05.
    
    Colour: dark olive (#626B4C).
    
    Left aligned.
    
    Maximum width: 440px.
    
    Preserve the two-line heading structure.
    
    First paragraph:
    
    "Kiss and Kry began with a simple belief: the very first things a baby wears should be the softest, kindest things they ever touch."
    
    Second paragraph:
    
    "So we chose bamboo, kept every design simple to dress and easy to love, and finished each piece with care. Considered essentials, made to bring a little more meaning to every day."
    
    Typography:
    
    Montserrat Regular.
    
    Font size: 12px.
    
    Line height: 1.65.
    
    Colour: soft grey olive (#858575).
    
    Paragraph spacing: 12px.
    
    Maximum width: 440px.
    
    Brand signature:
    
    "With love, Team Kiss and Kry"
    
    Montserrat Bold.
    
    12px.
    
    Dark olive.
    
    Below it:
    
    "Thoughtfully made. For every comfort."
    
    Montserrat Regular.
    
    10px.
    
    Muted olive.
    
    3. BRAND VALUES – THREE PILL BADGES
    
    Under the brand signature, create three small horizontally aligned pill-shaped badges.
    
    Badge 1:
    
    Small circular icon: sparkle / star.
    
    Text: "Thoughtfully made"
    
    Badge 2:
    
    Small circular icon: leaf.
    
    Text: "Bamboo viscose"
    
    Badge 3:
    
    Small circular icon: heart.
    
    Text: "Everyday comfort"
    
    Design:
    
    Background: white / warm off-white (#FFFFFF).
    
    Rounded pill shape.
    
    Thin subtle border.
    
    Small circular icon background in pale beige.
    
    Icon colour: muted olive.
    
    Text colour: dark olive.
    
    Font: Montserrat Medium, 9px.
    
    Horizontal padding: 12px.
    
    Vertical padding: 7px.
    
    Gap: 8px.
    
    Keep all three badges on one line on desktop.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    width: {{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%;
    max-width: 100%;
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding: 65px 55px;
    background: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.body_color }};
  }

  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }} *,
  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }} *::before,
  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }} *::after {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 46fr 54fr;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 36px;
  }

  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__copy {
    min-width: 0;
    max-width: 440px;
  }

  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    color: {{ block.settings.accent_color }};
    font-family: var(--ai-story-font-body-{{ ai_gen_id }});
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    line-height: 1.4;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading {
    margin: 0 0 22px;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    font-family: var(--ai-story-font-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }});
    font-size: 40px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -1.2px;
    line-height: 1.05;
  }

  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__paragraphs {
    max-width: 440px;
    color: {{ block.settings.body_color }};
    font-family: var(--ai-story-font-body-{{ ai_gen_id }});
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__paragraphs p {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }

  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__paragraphs p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__signoff {
    margin: 20px 0 4px;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    font-family: var(--ai-story-font-body-{{ ai_gen_id }});
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__tagline {
    margin: 0;
    color: {{ block.settings.accent_color }};
    font-family: var(--ai-story-font-body-{{ ai_gen_id }});
    font-size: 10px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badges {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: nowrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 20px;
  }

  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 7px;
    padding: 7px 12px;
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.badge_border }};
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: {{ block.settings.badge_background }};
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    font-family: var(--ai-story-font-body-{{ ai_gen_id }});
    font-size: 9px;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.2;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon {
    display: inline-flex;
    width: 19px;
    height: 19px;
    flex: 0 0 19px;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: {{ block.settings.icon_background }};
    color: {{ block.settings.icon_color }};
  }

  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon svg {
    display: block;
    width: 11px;
    height: 11px;
    fill: none;
    stroke: currentColor;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
    stroke-width: 1.6;
  }

  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__visual {
    width: 100%;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 360px;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #eeece1;
  }

  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    max-height: 600px;
    color: #d9d6c8;
  }

  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__empty-state {
    position: absolute;
    right: 12px;
    bottom: 12px;
    left: 12px;
    margin: 0;
    color: #555846;
    font-family: var(--ai-story-font-body-{{ ai_gen_id }});
    font-size: 12px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 42px 22px;
    }

    .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 30px;
    }

    .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__copy {
      max-width: 100%;
    }

    .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading {
      font-size: clamp(34px, 9vw, 40px);
    }

    .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badges {
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder {
      min-height: 260px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<div class="ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner">
    <div class="ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__copy">
      {% if block.settings.eyebrow != blank %}
        <p class="ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow">{{ block.settings.eyebrow | escape }}</p>
      {% endif %}
      <h2 class="ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading">{{ block.settings.heading | escape | newline_to_br }}</h2>
      <div class="ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__paragraphs">
        {{ block.settings.story_text }}
      </div>
      {% if block.settings.signature != blank %}
        <p class="ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__signoff">{{ block.settings.signature | escape }}</p>
      {% endif %}
      {% if block.settings.tagline != blank %}
        <p class="ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__tagline">{{ block.settings.tagline | escape }}</p>
      {% endif %}
      <div class="ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badges" aria-label="Brand values">
        <span class="ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge">
          <span class="ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="m8 1 1.5 4.2L14 7l-4.5 1.4L8 13l-1.5-4.6L2 7l4.5-1.8L8 1Z"/><path d="m13 10 .7 1.7L15 12.5l-1.3.6L13 15l-.7-1.9-1.3-.6 1.3-.8L13 10Z"/></svg></span>
          {{ block.settings.badge_one | escape }}
        </span>
        <span class="ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge">
          <span class="ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M13.8 2.2C8.3 2.1 4.2 3.4 3 7.1c-.8 2.5.7 4.8 3.2 4.8 3.7 0 6.6-4.5 7.6-9.7Z"/><path d="M2 14c2.1-3.8 4.6-5.9 8.2-7.7"/></svg></span>
          {{ block.settings.badge_two | escape }}
        </span>
        <span class="ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge">
          <span class="ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M8 14s-5.8-3.5-5.8-7.6A3.1 3.1 0 0 1 8 4.7a3.1 3.1 0 0 1 5.8 1.7C13.8 10.5 8 14 8 14Z"/></svg></span>
          {{ block.settings.badge_three | escape }}
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__visual">
      {% if block.settings.image != blank %}
        <img class="ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image" src="{{ block.settings.image | image_url: width: 1400 }}" alt="{{ block.settings.image.alt | default: block.settings.heading | escape }}" loading="lazy" width="{{ block.settings.image.width }}" height="{{ block.settings.image.height }}">
      {% else %}
        <div class="ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder">
          {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
          <p class="ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__empty-state">Add an editorial brand image to complete this story section.</p>
        </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Brand story editorial",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "range", "id": "desktop_width_percent", "label": "Desktop width", "min": 50, "max": 100, "step": 5, "unit": "%", "default": 100 },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "image", "label": "Editorial image" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Story content" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "— OUR STORY" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "For Every Kiss.\nFor Every Cry." },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "story_text", "label": "Story paragraphs", "default": "<p>Kiss and Kry began with a simple belief: the very first things a baby wears should be the softest, kindest things they ever touch.</p><p>So we chose bamboo, kept every design simple to dress and easy to love, and finished each piece with care. Considered essentials, made to bring a little more meaning to every day.</p>" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "signature", "label": "Signature", "default": "With love, Team Kiss and Kry" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "tagline", "label": "Tagline", "default": "Thoughtfully made. For every comfort." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Brand values" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "badge_one", "label": "First badge", "default": "Thoughtfully made" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "badge_two", "label": "Second badge", "default": "Bamboo viscose" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "badge_three", "label": "Third badge", "default": "Everyday comfort" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Colors" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "background_color", "label": "Background", "default": "#F5F3E7" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "heading_color", "label": "Heading and badge text", "default": "#626B4C" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "body_color", "label": "Paragraph text", "default": "#69695A" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "accent_color", "label": "Accent text", "default": "#777D5D" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "badge_background", "label": "Badge background", "default": "#FFFFFF" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "badge_border", "label": "Badge border", "default": "#DFDED2" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "icon_background", "label": "Icon background", "default": "#EEEBDD" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "icon_color", "label": "Icon", "default": "#626B4C" }
  ],
  "presets": [
    { "name": "Brand story editorial" }
  ],
  "tag": null,
  "class": "brand-story-editorial"
}
{% endschema %}